icant status="new"  format="epo"><addressbook><name>MATSUBARA RYO</name><address><country>JP</country> </address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OTA MASAKI</name><address><country>JP</country> </address> </addressbook> </applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SUITOU KEN</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TOYODA AUTOMATIC LOOM WORKS</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ADANIYA, TAKU</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KABUSHIKI KAISHA TOYODA JIDOSHOKKI SEISAKUSHO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MATSUBARA, RYO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OTA, MASAKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SUITOU, KEN</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ADANIYA TAKU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MATSUBARA RYO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OTA MASAKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SUITOU KEN</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ADANIYA, TAKU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MATSUBARA, RYO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OTA, MASAKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SUITOU, KEN</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A variable displacement compressor, comprising a delivery pressure area filled with a delivery pressure and a gas feed path for feeding gas from the delivery pressure area to a crank chamber, wherein an inlet side valve mechanism is provided in the gas feed path and opens and closes the gas feed path to control a pressure inside the crank chamber, an adjusting mechanism is provided in the gas feed path between the inlet side valve mechanism and the crank chamber and changes, with the elapse of time, the amount of gas fed from the delivery pressure area to the crank chamber through the gas feed path in response to the opening of the gas feed path by the inlet side valve mechanism, whereby the delivery capacity of the compressor can be changed rapidly to the minimum delivery capacity, and the compressor can be operated at the optimum efficiency.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>La présente invention concerne un compresseur à déplacement variable comprenant une zone à pression débitée remplie d'une pression de débit et un chemin d'alimentation en gaz servant à alimenter le gaz de la zone à pression de débit vers un carter. En l'occurrence, un mécanisme à soupape côté admission monté dans le chemin d'alimentation en gaz s'ouvre et se ferme de façon à réguler la pression intérieure du carter. De plus, un dispositif de régulation est installé dans le chemin d'alimentation en gaz, entre le mécanisme de soupape côté admission et le carter. En fonction du temps écoulé, le dispositif modifie la quantité de gaz introduite dans le carter depuis la zone de pression de débit via le chemin d'alimentation en gaz, et ce, en réaction à l'ouverture du chemin d'alimentation en gaz par le mécanisme de soupape côté admission. Cela permet de faire passer rapidement la capacité de débit du compresseur à une capacité minimale de débit, et ainsi de mettre en oeuvre le compresseur avec un maximum d'efficacité.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>